t;">42,175 shares of our common stock reserved for future issuance under our equity incentive plans. </div></td></tr></table><div class="BRDSX_para" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: left;">Except as otherwise indicated, all information in this prospectus assumes: (i) no exercise of outstanding stock options after December&#160;31, 2024, (ii) no exercise of Series&#160;F Preferred Stock or Series&#160;J Convertible Preferred Stock after December&#160;31, 2024, (iii) no exercise of warrants after December&#160;31, 2024 (including any pre-funded warrants, common warrants or Representative Warrants offered hereby), and (iv) no exercise of the underwriters&#8217; option to purchase additional securities. </div></div></div><div class="BRDSX_block-frill" style="width: 468pt; margin-top: 12pt; margin-left: 36pt;"><div class="BRDSX_unknown" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 9.47pt; text-align: center;">32<br></div></div></div>
